# Inbox for the "Book a Demo" / enquiry mailto links (inlined at build time —
# see src/lib/site.ts). Set it in Vercel to route enquiries to the business
# inbox; without it the links fall back to the address in that file.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=you@yourdomain.com.au

# ── Stripe ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Read by the serverless function api/checkout.ts (never by the browser).
# Set these in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables, then
# redeploy. Go-live steps: docs/stripe-go-live.md.
#
# Required. sk_test_… to rehearse with test cards, sk_live_… to take real money.
# Without it the checkout's final button offers "email my order" instead.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=

# Optional. Stripe Price IDs, if you'd rather manage the products in the
# Stripe dashboard. Their amounts must match src/lib/catalogue.ts — the page
# shows those figures. Leave blank to price inline from that file.
STRIPE_PRICE_CORE=
STRIPE_PRICE_OVERSPEED=
STRIPE_PRICE_ONBOARDING=

# Optional. Canonical origin Stripe sends buyers back to (defaults to the
# domain the order was placed on).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://apexaustralia.vercel.app
